					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "It is easier to keep track of various parts of the computation if we disable automatic\nindex raising/lowering, so we use \\verb|position=independent| on the indices. "
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "It is easier to keep track of various parts of the computation if we disable automatic\nindex raising/lowering, so we use \\verb|position=independent| on the indices. "
