			"source": "e^{m \\mu}::Vielbein;\ne_{m \\mu}::InverseVielbein;\ng^{\\mu\\nu}::InverseMetric;\ng_{\\mu\\nu}::Metric;\n\\delta_{m n}::Metric;\n\\delta^{m n}::InverseMetric;\n\\delta^{s}_{r}::KroneckerDelta;\n\\omega_{\\mu m n}::TableauSymmetry( indices={1,2}, shape={1,1} );\n{ e_{m}^{\\mu}, \\psi_{\\mu}, e, T^{\\mu}_{\\nu\\rho}, \\omega_{\\mu m n} }::Depends(\\partial{#});"
